WEBVTT

00:00:00.339 --> 00:00:01.640
And the bedrock of this entire

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.380
platform is something they call OneLake.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.880
OneLake is fundamental to understanding

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.899
how the ontology actually executes.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.040
It is the shared data foundation.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.180
Like a massive hard drive for

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.420
the company. The architectural philosophy

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.280
here is that different teams within

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.880
an organization, data scientists, financial

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.580
analysts, operations managers, can

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:23.960
all work with the exact same

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.720
underlying govern data.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.200
But using their own tools.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.580
Exactly. They access it through different

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.320
analytical compute engines depending

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.439
on their specific needs.
